&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Permanent position available with a considerable portfolio of works for the next 5+ years&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To build your career by assisting in the delivery of ‘leading edge’ engineering projects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To work with a vibrant, agile and multi-functional team in delivering projects on time, safely, to budget and to the required quality standards.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To benefit from Kirby’s Career Development Programmes that will enhance your leadership capability.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To work with the best.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent package on offer with room for negotiations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Kirby Group Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Kirby Group Engineering is an international multi-disciplinary engineering services contractor and leading provider of high-value engineering services to a number of ‘blue chip’ companies. Operating across Ireland, the UK, Europe and South Africa, Kirby has become the engineering service provider of choice in growth segments such as pharmaceuticals, data centres and power transmission and distribution. Our culture is innovative, collaborative and performance focused. The successful candidate will have the opportunity to grow and develop in a company committed to developing talent and rewarding performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Purpose&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;An exciting opportunity for a ‘Senior Authorised Person’ lead has arisen for an energetic individual who would enjoy working in a fast-paced environment. To build your career by assisting in the delivery of ‘leading edge’ engineering projects. To work with a vibrant, agile and multi-functional team in delivering projects on time, safely, to budget and to the required quality standards. To benefit from Kirby’s Career Development Programmes that will enhance your leadership capability. To work with the best.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Authorised Person&amp;nbsp; Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engages from early in the project with Site Management team with the agreed Electrical Safe Systems of Work Procedure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured mentoring / Workshops with the testing &amp;amp; commissioning technicians in line with an agreed Commissioning plan with the Project manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensures all Workplace personnel are aware of and are complying with the Electrical Safe Systems of Work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Issues and controls Permits for all Energised working activities under scope of work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attend daily testing &amp;amp; commissioning meetings as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To review and understand project specifications and drawings fully and extract the project specific requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow Strict Operational Procedures and Adhere to High Voltage Safety Rules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interpretation of basic electrical protection under fault conditions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage Safety documents and lock out/tag out procedures and philosophies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry out review of Switchgear Distribution Topology and Controls prior to start-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attend Project daily white board progress / Look ahead meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support / liaise with specialist Testing &amp;amp; Commissioning contractors to carry out early reviews and agree commissioning sequences and test scripts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with Control System providers (Scada/BMS/EMS etc.) in the development of the system handover under permit control schedule and protocols.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage initial start-up an...

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;DigiCert is a global leader in intelligent trust. We protect the digital world by ensuring the security, privacy, and authenticity of every interaction. Our AI-powered DigiCert ONE platform unifies PKI, DNS, and certificate lifecycle management, to secure infrastructure, software, devices, messages, AI content and agents. Learn why more than 100,000 organizations, including 90% of the Fortune 500, choose DigiCert to stop today’s threats and prepare for a quantum-safe future at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.digicert.com/&quot;&gt;www.digicert.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a Major Account Executive, you will be responsible for driving profitable revenue growth across a defined portfolio of strategic enterprise accounts and high-potential prospects in Central Europe.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You will own the full sales cycle, from identifying and developing new business opportunities to expanding existing customer relationships and closing complex, high-value enterprise agreements. By combining a consultative, value-based sales approach with a strong understanding of cybersecurity and digital trust, you will position DigiCert as a strategic partner to senior business and technology leaders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You will build trusted relationships with C-level executives, including CIOs, CISOs and CTOs, as well as IT infrastructure, security, architecture, and procurement stakeholders. Working closely with Sales Engineering, Sales Development, Marketing, Partner Sales, Customer Success, and executive leadership, you will develop account strategies that generate sustainable growth and long-term customer value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This is a quota-carrying role for an entrepreneurial, results-oriented enterprise sales professional who thrives in complex customer environments and takes full ownership of commercial outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strategic Account Development &amp;amp; New Business Acquisition&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Develop and execute strategic account plans for assigned enterprise accounts and high-potential prospects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Identify, qualify, and close new-logo opportunities while driving upsell and cross...

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bei Superchat gestalten wir neu, wie Unternehmen mit ihren Kund:innen kommunizieren. KI wird dabei immer mehr zum Motor dieser Kommunikation. Integrationen sind das, was diesem Motor echte Power gibt: die Daten, Tools und Systeme, die aus einem cleveren AI-Agenten einen machen, der Prozesse wirklich automatisiert und Probleme löst.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gegründet im Jahr 2020, ist Superchat heute die Plattform für über &lt;strong&gt;10.000 Unternehmen weltweit&lt;/strong&gt; - von bekannten Marken wie Allianz, Auto1, Enpal, Danone und GASAG bis hin zu kleinen Unternehmen, Zahnarztpraxen und Solo-Founder:innen, die professioneller auftreten möchten.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inzwischen laufen täglich &lt;strong&gt;Millionen von Nachrichten&lt;/strong&gt; über Superchat.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gestartet sind wir als Unified Inbox – ein zentraler Ort für alle Kommunikationskanäle wie WhatsApp, E-Mail, SMS oder Instagram. Mit dem Aufstieg von ChatGPT begann unser nächstes Kapitel: AI Agents, die über Chat, E-Mail und Voice in einer Qualität kommunizieren, die mit den besten menschlichen Teams mithalten kann.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Heute sind wir ein Team von rund &lt;strong&gt;100 Mitarbeitenden&lt;/strong&gt;, arbeiten profitabel und haben insgesamt &lt;strong&gt;18 Millionen Euro Funding&lt;/strong&gt; eingesammelt (unsere letzte Finanzierungsrunde liegt bereits 4,5 Jahre zurück – seitdem wachsen wir aus eigener Kraft weiter).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unser Hauptsitz ist in Berlin.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;In dieser Rolle bist du verantwortlich für den gesamten Sales-Zyklus im DACH-Markt. Du bearbeitest warme Inbound-Anfragen und akquirierst gleichzeitig eigenständig neue Leads, vereinbarst und führst Demo-Termine durch und begleitest den gesamten Prozess bis zum erfolgreichen Abschluss. Darüber hinaus unterstützt du bei der technischen Implementierung, um sicherzustellen, dass neue Kund:innen erfolgreich starten.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Want&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recent Graduate with an Interest in B2B Sales.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Du hast dein Studium (z.B. BWL, Kommunikation, Wirtschaftsinformatik oder vergleichbar) kürzlich abgeschlossen und bringst Interesse am B2B-Vertrieb mit.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong communicator.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Du sprichst muttersprachliches Deutsch und verfügst über sehr gute Englischkenntnisse.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Self-Confident.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Du glaubst an deine Fähigkeit, ein Gespräch zu führen und abzuschließen, ohne dabei arrogant zu wirken.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Self-Starter.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Du baust dir deine eigene Pipeline auf, statt auf eingehende Leads zu warten, und nutzt eine ruhige Woche, um noch aktiver zu prospektieren.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coachable.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Du nimmst direktes Feedback an, ohne defensiv zu werden, und wendest es sichtbar im nächsten Gespräch an.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resilient.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Du erholst dich schnell von einem verlorenen Deal oder einer schwierigen Woche und hältst deine Aktivität konstant hoch.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fast Learner.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Du arbeitest dich schnell in ein technisches Produkt ein und kannst es Kund:innen verständlich erklären.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Du hältst deine Pipeline sauber und deine CRM-Notizen zuverlässig, ohne dass man dir hinterherlaufen muss.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Who We Don’t Want&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;3:1-4:126;22-186&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relies on leads being handed o...

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bei Superchat gestalten wir neu, wie Unternehmen mit ihren Kund:innen kommunizieren. KI wird dabei immer mehr zum Motor dieser Kommunikation. Integrationen sind das, was diesem Motor echte Power gibt: die Daten, Tools und Systeme, die aus einem cleveren AI-Agenten einen machen, der Prozesse wirklich automatisiert und Probleme löst.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gegründet im Jahr 2020, ist Superchat heute die Plattform für über &lt;strong&gt;10.000 Unternehmen weltweit&lt;/strong&gt; - von bekannten Marken wie Allianz, Auto1, Enpal, Danone und GASAG bis hin zu kleinen Unternehmen, Zahnarztpraxen und Solo-Founder:innen, die professioneller auftreten möchten.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inzwischen laufen täglich &lt;strong&gt;Millionen von Nachrichten&lt;/strong&gt; über Superchat.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gestartet sind wir als Unified Inbox - ein zentraler Ort für alle Kommunikationskanäle wie WhatsApp, E-Mail, SMS oder Instagram. Mit dem Aufstieg von ChatGPT begann unser nächstes Kapitel: AI Agents, die über Chat, E-Mail und Voice in einer Qualität kommunizieren, die mit den besten menschlichen Teams mithalten kann.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Heute sind wir ein Team von rund &lt;strong&gt;100 Mitarbeitenden&lt;/strong&gt;, arbeiten profitabel und haben insgesamt &lt;strong&gt;18 Millionen Euro Funding&lt;/strong&gt; eingesammelt (unsere letzte Finanzierungsrunde liegt bereits 4,5 Jahre zurück - seitdem wachsen wir aus eigener Kraft weiter).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unser Hauptsitz ist in Berlin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;In diesem Praktikum im AI &amp;amp; Automation Squad hilfst du unseren Kund:innen, unsere KI-Features wirklich einzusetzen, hältst die operativen Abläufe im Hintergrund am Laufen und unterstützt unser Product Marketing. KI-Expert:in musst du dafür nicht sein - genau das lernst du hier.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das Praktikum ist in Vollzeit, dauert 6 Monate und startet so bald wie möglich in Berlin.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Want&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-lfile-container=&quot;d64d8663-7ac9-42d2-a1b9-4217c33bcd2e&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-facing at heart.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Du bist gerne im direkten Austausch mit Kund:innen, ob am Telefon oder im Meeting. Du hörst zu, verstehst, was dein Gegenüber braucht, und stellst dich auf jede Person individuell ein.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Explains tech in plain language.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Du kannst technische Themen so einfach erklären, dass sie auch Menschen verstehen, die nicht in der Tech-Branche arbeiten.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on, not just interested.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Du probierst ein Tool lieber aus, als nur darüber zu lesen. Wenn etwas Neues kommt, klickst du dich rein, testest herum und findest heraus, wie es funktioniert.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Takes ownership.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Du wartest nicht auf Schritt-für-Schritt-Anleitungen. Du übernimmst Aufgaben, treibst sie selbst voran und stellst Fragen, wenn du sie brauchst.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent German.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Du sprichst fließend Deutsch, denn die meisten deiner Kundengespräche finden auf Deutsch statt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Who We Don’t Want&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-lfile-container=&quot;d64d8663-7ac9-42d2-a1b9-4217c33bcd2e&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;3 3 []&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du kommst nicht vom Fachjargon los - du sprichst in Anglizismen und Tech-Begriffen und tust dich schwer, dich auf eine:n SMB-Inhaber:in am Telefon einzustellen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du willst reine Marketing- oder Content-Arbeit machen und Calls oder Customer-Success-Meetings lieber vermeiden&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du brauchst ständige Anleitung und wartest auf Schritt-für-Sch...

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We simplify wealth creation. Founded in 2014 in Vienna, Austria by Eric Demuth, Paul Klanschek and Christian Trummer, we’re here to help people trust themselves enough to build their financial freedom — for now and the future. Our user-friendly, trade-everything platform empowers both first-time investors and seasoned experts to invest in the cryptocurrencies, crypto indices, stocks*, precious metals and commodities* they want — with any sized budget, 24/7. Our global team works across different cultures and time zones, bringing our products to more than 7 million customers, making us one of Europe’s safest and most secure platforms that powers modern investing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Austria but operating across Europe, our products are built by fast-moving, talented, “roll-up-your-sleeves-and-make-it-happen” kind of people. It’s these diverse perspectives and innovative minds operating as ONE TEAM that keep Bitpanda at the cutting edge of our industry. So if you’re someone who thinks big, moves fast and wants to make an impact right from day one, then get ready to join our industry-changing team. Let’s go!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Designer on Bitpanda’s Web3 team, you will architect the user experiences that power our next-generation crypto ecosystem, from asset-backed loans in the Bitpanda app to tokenised structured products in the Vision Wallet. You will transform complex, data-heavy financial workflows into seamless interfaces, navigating the unique challenges of a fast-moving, highly regulated space. Partnering tightly with engineering, product, and compliance teams, your designs will directly drive customer engagement, retention, and trust. You&#39;ll shape Bitpanda&#39;s newest business lines, using AI to go from idea to working prototypes in hours and to testing them with real customers within days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and develop end-to-end trading, investment, and Web3 interfaces across both mobile and web platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Simplify highly complex financial products (such as tokenized financial derivatives) into intuitive, low-friction user experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct comprehensive user research, usability testing, and behavioral analysis to optimize funnel conversion, engagement, and drop-off rates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply and continuously contribute to scalable design systems, ensuring consistency and performance across data-heavy interfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI to prototype, test and ship faster: build working, coded prototypes in hours, test them with customers within days, and keep our design system ready for engineers&#39; AI coding tools to build from&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven knowledge and experience in Product, UX, and UI Design, with a mandatory strong background in Crypto, Web3, or complex fintech products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert in Figma and interaction design, and AI-native in how you work: you already use AI tools to build coded prototypes and test ideas fast.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience simplifying complex financial concepts and workflows into accessible, user-centric designs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical knowledge of working within regulated, fast-moving environments while maintaining high design delivery velocity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong data-informed mindset with experience in continuous optimization based on user metrics, coupled with deep customer empathy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;** This position is available remotely in one of our Hubs.&lt;/strong...

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We simplify wealth creation. Founded in 2014 in Vienna, Austria by Eric Demuth, Paul Klanschek and Christian Trummer, we’re here to help people trust themselves enough to build their financial freedom — for now and the future. Our user-friendly, trade-everything platform empowers both first-time investors and seasoned experts to invest in the cryptocurrencies, crypto indices, stocks*, precious metals and commodities* they want — with any sized budget, 24/7. Our global team works across different cultures and time zones, bringing our products to more than 7 million customers, making us one of Europe’s safest and most secure platforms that powers modern investing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Austria but operating across Europe, our products are built by fast-moving, talented, “roll-up-your-sleeves-and-make-it-happen” kind of people. It’s these diverse perspectives and innovative minds operating as ONE TEAM that keep Bitpanda at the cutting edge of our industry. So if you’re someone who thinks big, moves fast and wants to make an impact right from day one, then get ready to join our industry-changing team. Let’s go!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bitpanda serves millions of investors across Europe, and we&#39;re bringing regulated finance onchain with Vision Chain, our own OP Stack L2 blockchain. We are building the premier ecosystem for European financial institutions to issue and distribute euro-denominated tokenized assets. We&#39;re hiring a Lead Technical Product Manager to own Vision Chain as a product: the foundation that Bitpanda&#39;s onchain products run on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll own how the chain works and evolves, covering topics spanning proof systems, core protocol modifications, selecting the infrastructure providers, and more. You&#39;ll design and implement compliance, identity and privacy solutions into and on the chain, to satisfy the requirements of both financial institutions and developers. You&#39;ll work on this in collaboration with both internal and external product and engineering teams, as well as Bitpanda&#39;s Compliance, Legal and Data Protection teams, as an individual contributor reporting to the Head of Web3 Product within a small, senior team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Vision Chain at the infrastructure level, managing configuration choices (fee mechanism, block building logic, etc.), and modifications to the OP Stack, in collaboration with the OP Labs team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage infrastructure partnerships, owning the technical relationship with providers (RPC nodes, indexing, oracles, etc.).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Compliance and Legal to implement regulatorily-compliant onchain transaction screening, identity, and privacy solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run reliability, incidents and cost, and own developer documentation and partner technical onboarding until a developer relations lead joins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with the other Vision Web3 product leads to ensure the chain’s technical roadmap supports the product roadmap being built on top of it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of product or engineering experience, with 3+ years focused on blockchain infrastructure (e.g., L1/L2, rollup-as-a-service, node infrastructure provider, account abstraction, or an exchange protocol team).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of EVM rollup mechanics, including sequencing, fees, proofs, withdrawals, bridges, upgrade keys, and account abstraction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to translate complex bu...

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We simplify wealth creation. Founded in 2014 in Vienna, Austria by Eric Demuth, Paul Klanschek and Christian Trummer, we’re here to help people trust themselves enough to build their financial freedom — for now and the future. Our user-friendly, trade-everything platform empowers both first-time investors and seasoned experts to invest in the cryptocurrencies, crypto indices, stocks*, precious metals and commodities* they want — with any sized budget, 24/7. Our global team works across different cultures and time zones, bringing our products to more than 7 million customers, making us one of Europe’s safest and most secure platforms that powers modern investing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Austria but operating across Europe, our products are built by fast-moving, talented, “roll-up-your-sleeves-and-make-it-happen” kind of people. It’s these diverse perspectives and innovative minds operating as ONE TEAM that keep Bitpanda at the cutting edge of our industry. So if you’re someone who thinks big, moves fast and wants to make an impact right from day one, then get ready to join our industry-changing team. Let’s go!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bitpanda serves millions of investors across Europe, and we&#39;re bringing regulated finance onchain with Vision Chain, our own OP Stack L2 blockchain. We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Lead Product Manager, DeFi&lt;/strong&gt; to build Bitpanda’s DeFi ecosystem from the ground up, creating the world’s premier Euro-denominated DeFi ecosystem while making it safe, accessible, and intuitive for our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The first use case is crypto-backed borrowing and lending in the Bitpanda app, with an eye to then build more sophisticated products and use cases leveraging tokenized commodities, securities, funds, and structured products. You’ll decide which protocols and partners come to Vision Chain, and work collaboratively to bring DeFi to Bitpanda customers in a way that feels as simple as the app they already trust. You&#39;ll work in a small, senior team with our smart contract engineers and Bitpanda&#39;s Legal, Compliance and Risk teams, as an individual contributor reporting to the Head of Web3 Product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and run the lending markets: set loan-to-value and liquidation thresholds, interest rate curves, caps, and oracles, while also owning monitoring and incident playbooks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring liquidity and users to permissioned markets and assets: set supply targets, bring in euro liquidity from stablecoin issuers, institutional lenders, curated vaults and market makers, and work out how verified customers reach these markets, without paying for volume.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make sure the right DeFi infrastructure is in place, particularly for permissioned tokenized assets: DEX liquidity deep enough for swaps and liquidations, liquidators, oracles and the other building blocks the markets depend on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape what customers see, sign, and own in the Bitpanda app, including how liquidation and risk are explained, and measure real use: borrowers who come back, bad debt and revenue, not total value locked alone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recommend which protocols and partners come to Vision Chain, backed by a business case, and work with Legal, Compliance and Risk from day one on EU consumer credit rules and MiCA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of Product Management experience, with at least 3+ years focused specifically on building and scaling DeFi or crypto products.&l...

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission Brief&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are the guardian and the challenger of our security posture. At Isar Aerospace, the systems that build our rockets and the ground systems that launch them are mission critical, and protecting them takes more than good design. It takes someone who will attack their own work to be sure it holds.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a deeply hands-on Senior Security Engineer. You live in the consoles, the rule sets and the code. You own our secure access and network security controls, our endpoint and identity security stack, and our detection content, and you operate them yourself rather than directing from the sidelines. You wear two hats: the Builder who implements and runs the controls that keep us safe, and the Adversary who keeps testing whether those controls and detections actually fire.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior engineering role with the spirit of an architect. You are expected to design what you operate, not just configure it: pick the pattern, write it down, and make it hold at fleet scale. A versatile engineer with real depth, comfortable switching from a firewall rule set to a detection query to a directory hardening sprint in the same week, and a technical anchor others lean on.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role in Our Space Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SASE and Network Security&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own and operate our SASE platform&lt;/strong&gt;, including revamping Internet Security policies and redefining Private Access policies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive firewall security with the network team: &lt;/strong&gt;own network security engineering and segmentation strategy, analyze rule sets, identify gaps, and see remediation through together with network engineering, who own the devices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coordinate firewall-adjacent controls: &lt;/strong&gt;IPS, AV, sandboxing and DDoS protection.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage our DNS security and WAF solutions&lt;/strong&gt;, including our edge and CDN-based protection services.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security Posture and Hardening&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply CIS Benchmarks &lt;/strong&gt;to raise posture across firewalls, endpoints, our cloud identity platform and our cloud productivity suite.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the clean-up and hardening of our on-premises and cloud identity directories &lt;/strong&gt;together with the infrastructure team, then keep both hardened on an ongoing basis.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive our phishing-resistant MFA and privileged access programme, &lt;/strong&gt;including just-in-time elevation and the remediation of the attack paths we find.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own certificate lifecycle and PKI operations: &lt;/strong&gt;key ceremonies, automated renewal, and input to our post-quantum migration plan.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Detection and Visibility&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage and tune our IPS/IDS platforms; &lt;/strong&gt;write and maintain custom IDS signatures, and operate network sensors for NTA appliances.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and maintain detections in our SIEM &lt;/strong&gt;and apply MITRE ATT&amp;amp;CK to detection engineering and use-case design in support of the SOC.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extend visibility into OT &lt;/strong&gt;with purpo...

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Mission Brief&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a Senior Launch Operations Engineer,&amp;nbsp;you’ll&amp;nbsp;join&amp;nbsp;the team in Germany&amp;nbsp;that shapes how our missions come to life.&amp;nbsp;From the moment a campaign is conceived, you are the one aligning global launch sites, synchronizing teams and defining the operational path that&amp;nbsp;ultimately determines&amp;nbsp;how—and whether—the rocket leaves the ground.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Within the global Launch Operations team, you stand at the core of our mission: transforming complex campaigns into repeatable,&amp;nbsp;scalable&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;reliable&amp;nbsp;operations&amp;nbsp;over multiple launch sites. Your work creates&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;structure that enables teams across the world to execute with confidence and precision.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;When a campaign moves from planning to execution, you step directly into the field—joining local teams on site, leading coordination efforts&amp;nbsp;in the company, and operations both inside and outside the control room. In these moments, you carry the responsibility of turning months of preparation into a successful launch day.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
